{"ticker":"NDSN","updated":"2026-10-23T23:21:53Z","profile":{"longName":"Nordson Corporation","shortName":"Nordson Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.nordson.com","fullTimeEmployees":8200,"marketCap":17759186944,"trailingPE":32.271255,"forwardPE":24.558535,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.959869,"pegRatio":1.82,"targetMeanPrice":349.7143,"targetHighPrice":375.0,"targetLowPrice":282.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":7,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.103,"earningsGrowth":0.23,"grossMargins":0.55391,"operatingMargins":0.27403998,"profitMargins":0.18631001,"totalRevenue":2979794944,"beta":0.992,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":339.12,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":223.29,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.18},"summary":"Nordson Corporation engineers, manufactures, and markets products and systems to dispense, apply, and control adhesives, coatings, polymers, sealants, biomaterials, medical components, and other fluids. The Industrial Precision Solutions segment provides dispensing, coating, and laminating systems for adhesives, lotions, liquids, and fibers to disposable products and roll goods; automated adhesive dispensing systems; components and systems for thermoplastic and biopolymer melt stream; fluid components, such as nozzles, pumps, and filters; smart components that measure and control the flow, quantity and location of dispensed fluid; control systems; and product assembly solutions. It also offers automated and manual dispensing products and systems for cold materials, container coating, liquid finishing, and powder coating, as well as ultraviolet equipment. The Medical and Fluid Solutions segment offers precision manual and semi-automated dispensers, plastic molded syringes, cartridges, tips, and fluid connection components; interventional solutions for engineered shafts and interventional delivery systems, medical tubing, balloons, balloon inflators, nitinol devices, cardiovascular cannula, and biomaterial delivery; medical fluid components; and microplegia myocardial protection devices and related consumables. The Advanced Technology Solutions segment provides automated dispensi","summary_zh":"Nordson Corporation 設計、製造和銷售用於分配、塗抹和控制黏合劑、塗料、聚合物、密封劑、生物材料、醫療組件和其他流體的產品和系統。工業精密解決方案部門為一次性產品和捲材的黏合劑、乳液、液體和纖維提供點膠、塗層和層壓系統；自動黏合劑分配系統；用於熱塑性塑膠和生物聚合物熔體流的組件和系統；流體部件，例如噴嘴、泵浦和過濾器；測量和控制所分配流體的流量、數量和位置的智慧組件；控制系統和產品組裝解決方案。它還提供用於冷材料、容器塗裝、液體塗飾和粉末塗裝的自動和手動點膠產品和系統，以及紫外線設備。醫療和流體解決方案部門提供精密手動和半自動分配器、塑膠模製注射器、藥筒、吸頭和流體連接組件；用於工程軸和介入輸送系統、醫用管材、球囊、球囊充氣機、鎳鈦諾裝置、心血管插管和生物材料輸送的介入解決方案；醫用液體成分；和微耗材心肌保護裝置及相關裝置、心血管插管和生物材料傳輸的介入解決方案；先進技術解決方案部門提供自動化分配","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":226.64,"h":228.05,"l":224.54,"c":225.79,"v":408200},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":225.82,"h":228.79,"l":225.0,"c":226.35,"v":607300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":225.35,"h":227.66,"l":224.07,"c":225.67,"v":245900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":227.22,"h":227.22,"l":223.24,"c":224.67,"v":214700},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":224.96,"h":226.58,"l":224.12,"c":225.09,"v":282200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":223.43,"h":223.43,"l":220.06,"c":222.7,"v":261200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":221.98,"h":222.93,"l":220.41,"c":221.97,"v":258000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":222.16,"h":226.05,"l":220.35,"c":226.01,"v":206800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":227.11,"h":229.02,"l":223.69,"c":225.03,"v":255800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":225.7,"h":227.09,"l":222.11,"c":226.13,"v":401700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":225.16,"h":225.16,"l":221.09,"c":222.11,"v":211800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":221.43,"h":224.02,"l":221.43,"c":223.72,"v":244100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":222.77,"h":228.23,"l":221.54,"c":227.98,"v":393800},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":227.02,"h":227.02,"l":222.81,"c":223.17,"v":195900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":223.18,"h":226.8,"l":223.0,"c":225.92,"v":406500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":225.92,"h":227.65,"l":225.18,"c":226.13,"v":306200},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":226.13,"h":231.0,"l":223.24,"c":223.64,"v":341300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":223.91,